Others have discussed projectiles.

Consider what type of monster a mumak is.  Reading through
the sources, there are two types of monsters that have
trunks.  Mastadons and mumaks.  A mumak is a type of
elephant.  No wonder they are so hard to kill.  No wonder
they hit so hard.

So, was it obvious?  Before you learn how powerfull each type
of monster is, no.  After you learn how powerfull each type of
monster is, yes.  In Nethack the most common way to learn
a lesson is to die.  Die without learning some lesson, fail to
progress towards ascending.  Die with learning some lesson,
succeed in progress towards ascending.  There are a finite
number of lessons to be learned in Nethack.  Huge number
but finite number.



